WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.480
Welcome back to the arena. You've completed your preseason conditioning. You looked inward,

00:13.480 --> 00:20.200
you gathered the intel, you created your inner blueprint. You now have the raw materials,

00:20.200 --> 00:28.000
your values, your strengths, your key experiences. This will shape how you not only win from

00:28.000 --> 00:36.760
within, but it will shape how you begin to show up to those around you. Now today we move from

00:36.760 --> 00:43.760
reviewing the game tape to drafting the playbook. We'll take the intel from your personal scouting

00:43.760 --> 00:52.800
report and use it to design the single most important tool for your leadership. Your M.V.P.

00:53.800 --> 01:02.200
blueprint, which stands for your mission, vision, purpose, and values. After you've architected your

01:02.200 --> 01:09.560
M.V.P., I'm going to introduce you to the performance system that will bring it all to life, the 90-day

01:09.560 --> 01:16.800
way. This isn't about writing a purpose statement for a slide deck. It's about building your

01:16.800 --> 01:24.680
strategic operating system that scales your leadership. This lesson is about building your

01:24.680 --> 01:33.360
game plan. The A.R.A.W. pillars we are conditioning today are alignment and agility. Let's get to work.

